{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y的主叙事压缩后，部分关键因果和心理转折不如X清楚，例如S05省略了此前几次收住、对方却持续亲近的铺垫，S13把想听到永远的承诺写得近似心愿已经说出口，叙事准确性和连贯性有所退步。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y的关键词加亮、话与感受交替排列，以及感受随音乐到时出现，让观众更容易在听音乐时抓住当前重点，不必在两列之间反复寻找对应关系；感受描写也更有声响、身体、空间和时间变化的具体质感。X的优势是人物为什么犹豫、为什么转念交代得更完整，前后心理因果更清楚。综合而言，我选Y，因为它的即时观看体验和音乐同步感略胜，但叙事完整性确实不如X。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa23e216-5fd3-4988-ab6e-806a1aabb7f0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T223854719440Z", "elapsed_seconds": 67.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:40:02.447398+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5f25ac9e3fe7873ddcf188588c43aa7bb13e633c4e896ed0dcf92a42f974e435", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238850000257